L475: The results of Bailey et al. [ 41 ] were important in demonstrating that the reduction in the whole-body oxygen cost of exercise following nitrate supplementation is consequent to changes in muscle energy metabolism. The proportional sparing of  \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
